        "TileImage": "$($repository 99d0bfc4-2918-444d-8373-db00b6d927d7).Image",
        "Description": "Dear Agent 47,\rsince &quot;the last incident&quot; on New York, ICA has set new guidelines and tactics towards how we choose clients.\r\rThe standards have been lowered to the degree, that we now accept bank robbing and horsing contracts from our &quot;clients&quot;.\r\rYour job 47, should u accept, is to rob the central bank of New York and make shure to safely transport the monetary goods from the bank.\rThis involves creative measures regarding guards and potential witnesses.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
